WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.100
Start with whatever’s on your mind.

00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:06.680
Press Command-K or Control-K, or tap the circle-plus

00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:09.520
button, to capture a thought, task, or idea

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:10.220
in your Inbox.

00:00:11.620 --> 00:00:13.080
You don’t need to organize it right away.

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:16.480
Later, decide whether it’s something to do, a

00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:18.980
goal to work toward, or information to keep

00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:21.200
— and add any details you’ll need.
